{"4559830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Havelyn", "steam_appid": 4559830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, quiet land stretches before you. The wind goes through the leaves of the trees, the sun shines brightly on the grass below. But something is missing. A place that feels like home. Explore the world alone or with up to four friends to find a spot you can call your home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life at Your Own Pace</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide, open landscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home wherever it feels right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant crops and live from the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with nearby villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome new residents and grow your settlement into a new civilisation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you build a quiet home for yourself or the foundation for something bigger - the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559830/extras/b75aaeda736417f054c85db2fa9f7b48.poster.avif?t=1787083485\" width=1170 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559830/extras/b75aaeda736417f054c85db2fa9f7b48.webm?t=1787083485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559830/extras/b75aaeda736417f054c85db2fa9f7b48.mp4?t=1787083485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense forests and open meadows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearby villages to discover and trade with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten ruins and fragments of past lives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret places known only to you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only the beginning for the world of Havelyn. The core experience is already playable, but we have much more planned. New features, expanded systems, and additional story content will continue to shape the game over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to follow development and help shape the future of Havelyn, join our Discord for updates, announcements, and community polls.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, quiet land stretches before you. The wind goes through the leaves of the trees, the sun shines brightly on the grass below. But something is missing. A place that feels like home. Explore the world alone or with up to four friends to find a spot you can call your home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life at Your Own Pace</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide, open landscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home wherever it feels right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant crops and live from the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with nearby villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome new residents and grow your settlement into a new civilisation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you build a quiet home for yourself or the foundation for something bigger - the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World to Explore</strong></h2><p cl